}],"egsCharacterIds":["831"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13104"},"originalCharacterName":"相原 りんご","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An energetic, aspiring young girl. A first-year student in nursing school and graduate of St. Michael’s. A hardworker who always maintains excellent grades."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s family friends with Chiaki, who is a nurse and teacher, and has admired her since they were little."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taking her acceptance to nursing school as an opportunity to become independent from her parents, she’s begun living with Chiaki in her apartment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Gyutto and Yurin Yurin"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13104"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主人公・ちょっと背伸び盛りの元気娘】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護学院の一年生で、ミカ女出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑張り屋で、成績は常に上位をキープ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナースで教官でもある千秋とは家族ぐるみの付き合いで、小さい頃からの憧れでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護学校入学を機に親離れを狙い、千秋のマンションに同居を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供扱いされるとむくれるが、アダルトなシチュにはすぐ赤くなってしまう純情娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"831","sourceWorkId":"18839","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちょっと背伸び盛りの元気娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護学院の一年生で、ミカ女出身。頑張り屋で、成績は常に上位をキープ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ナースで教官でもある千秋とは家族ぐるみの付き合いで、小さい頃からの憧れでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護学校入学を機に親離れを狙い、千秋のマンションに同居を始める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"声：本野しおり"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"19744"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/81c0052bcdf389e1502f0d78654874128ff2f21f53eb8ca0fe0522b0de181085.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/2091ac05ddd54b9b02410411ae504668f9e06590e6471804a8c06c5f1fbb23ec.webp","width":76,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本野しおり","creatorId":"vndb:s3869","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3869","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3869","name":"本野しおり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54153","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c13105","characterName":"高尾 千秋","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"19745","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"70195"}],"egsCharacterIds":["832"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13105"},"originalCharacterName":"高尾 千秋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A picture perfect nurse. …But she’s actually pretty spoiled. She’s both a nurse in the gastrointestinal surgery ward at Saint Michael’s General Hospital as well as a nursing instructor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With Ringo being accepted to nursing school, Chiaki offers to take her under her wing, and the two begin living together in her apartment."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ordinarily she’s a flawless model of a woman, but at home, she has surprisingly little concern for herself; in some ways, she’s a bit of a wreck."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Gyutto and Yurin Yurin"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13105"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【完全無欠の正看護師……実はかなり甘えん坊】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖ミカエル総合病院、消化器外科病棟勤務の看護師で、看護学生の教官を兼ねている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"りんごの看護学院合格を機に世話役を申し出ており、自身のマンションで同居を始める事に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段こそ完全無欠のお姉様であるものの、家では案外自身の事に関して無頓着な、ある意味ポンコツな人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"りんごと同居を切っ掛けに、べったりと甘えまくる様になってしまい、りんごを赤面させまくっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"832","sourceWorkId":"18839","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"完全無欠の正看護師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……実はかなり甘えん坊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖ミカエル総合病院、消化器外科病棟勤務の看護師で、看護学生の教官を兼ねている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"りんごの看護学院合格を機に世話役を申し出ており、自身のマンションで同居を始める事に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段こそ完全無欠のお姉様であるものの、家では案外自身の事に関して無頓着な、ある意味ポンコツな人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"声：一ノ瀬心香"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"19745"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b53b1dc7e302d93ca08fe7babf5be4aabf29d8c289215bf55faad2ccbc43f21.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f6ee0dd333c298f628b7d32b232e84763f881e0d0f4818c3a069640ba7db6e2.webp","width":72,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一ノ瀬 心香","creatorId":"vndb:s3870","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3870","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3870","name":"一ノ瀬 心香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54154","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c13130","characterName":"片倉 優乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29635","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"79483"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1523"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13130"},"originalCharacterName":"片倉 優乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An extreeemely pushy and overprotective girl who is in her first year of nursing school. Satsuki’s classmate and dormmate. Has a soft, feminine disposition. Fairly protective, she always speaks formally, with a deference to others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her overbearing disposition stems from her “What would you do without me?” attitude toward the frequently troubled Satsuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Yurin Yurin"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13130"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護学院の一年生で、皐とは同級生にして寮のルームメイトでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとするも女らしい性格。かなりの世話焼きで、誰にでも常に敬語で腰も低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当人には自覚がないが、スキンシップがかなり密接で、いわゆる隙が多い感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皐の困った性格に「この子は私が居ないとダメなんだから」的な庇護欲から世話焼きポジションに。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1523","sourceWorkId":"19269","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"押しの強～い世話焼き少女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"看護学院の一年生で、皐とは同級生にして寮のルームメイトでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとするも女らしい性格。かなりの世話焼きで、誰にでも常に敬語で腰も低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皐の困った性格に「この子は私が居ないとダメなんだから」的な庇護欲から世話焼きポジションに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"声：めりるゆか"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29635"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d81501aef90491429261b4d25fbf04da1a7b1894f357259f3117808cb11aaa4f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f578ce36c14db5f946bb9131031b0f3531d827ef6f89f7d25932a9042e76ce80.webp","width":63,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"めりる ゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s3871","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3871","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3871","name":"めりるゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:54155","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c13131","characterName":"石神 皐","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29634","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"79483"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1524"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13131"},"originalCharacterName":"石神 皐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A brilliant, but frank and aloof girl with boyish tendencies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"What you would call an aloof mystery. Up front and self-assured. She always speaks in a masculine way."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she’s never had much interest in eating, Yuuno has been using her home cooking to draw her out more, so that she’ll be straightforward with her expressions of affection, regardless of their surroundings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Yurin Yurin"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13131"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才だけど素直でクールなボクっ娘"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる素直クールな物怖じしない不思議ちゃん。一人称は「ボク」で、常に少年の様な口調で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空気を読まない発言や、ずけずけと物を言う性格が、他のクラスメイトとは、一定の距離を開けてしまいがちに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食べることに興味はなかったが、同室の優乃の手作り料理に餌付けされてしまい、それ以降、周囲の視線もなんのそので、ストレートに愛情表現してくる様に。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1524","sourceWorkId":"19269","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才だけど"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素直でクールなボクっ娘"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる素直クールな物怖じしない不思議ちゃん。一人称は「ボク」で、常に少年のような口調で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食べることに興味はなかったが、同室の優乃の手作り料理に餌付けされてしまい、それ以降、周囲の視線もなんのそので、ストレートに愛情表現してくるように。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29634"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d4e76e246d22dc7a1c3faf85695a5c8d929584bdf5ba618e66f87d097e95301.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adbfb7612afc38bc0fd7bfad396bfc7aea504226386ac998a49ad5aa556ce9ee.webp","width":64,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"設楽麻美","creatorId":"vndb:s869","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s869","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s869","name":"設楽 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:79483:29634:7904:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21936","characterName":"稲取 晶","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29637","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"91401"}],"egs